| currentCost / costLimit | ratio | 预期 level   | 源码依据 (`quota.ts`) |
|--------------------------|-------|-------------|------------------------|
| 5.0 / 10.0              | 0.50  | `"info"`     | `ratio >= 0.50` → info |
| 8.0 / 10.0              | 0.80  | `"warning"`  | `ratio >= 0.80` → warning |
